<translation id="5820394555380036790">I-Decentr OS</translation>
<translation id="5854740544000584380">I-Decentr OS yenziwe ukuthi isebenze ngesofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile owengeziwe<ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CROS_OSS" />isofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile<ph name="END_LINK_CROS_OSS" />, njengoba kunjalo ngendawo yokuthuthukiswa kwe-<ph name="BEGIN_LINK_LINUX_OSS" />Linux<ph name="END_LINK_LINUX_OSS" />.</translation>
