<translation id="8453117565092476964">Ingobo yomlando yesifaki yonakele noma ayivumelekile. Sicela ulande futhi i-Decentr.</translation>
<translation id="8493179195440786826">I-Decentr ayikho kudethi</translation>
<translation id="8550334526674375523">Le phrofayela yomsebenzi ihluke ngokugcwele kusukela kuphrofayela yakho siqu.</translation>
<translation id="8558383651099478961">Umzali wakho uvale "Izimvume zamasayithi, izinhlelo zokusebenza, nezandiso" ze-Decentr. Ukwengeza le <ph name="EXTENSION_TYPE_PARAMETER" /> akuvumelekile.</translation>
<translation id="8568283329061645092">I-Decentr ingahlola amaphasiwedi akho uma ungena ngemvume nge-Akhawunti yakho ye-Google</translation>
