<translation id="8621669128220841554">Ukufakwa kuhlulekile ngenxa yephutha elingacacisiwe. Sicela ulande i-Decentr futhi.</translation>
<translation id="8697124171261953979">Iphinda ilawule ukuthi yiliphi ikhasi eliboniswayo uma uqala i-Decentr noma usesho kusuka ku-Omnibox.</translation>
<translation id="8704119203788522458">Lena yi-Decentr yakho</translation>
<translation id="8796602469536043152">I-Decentr idinga imvume ukuze ifinyelele kukhamera yakho nemakrofoni yaleli sayithi</translation>
