<translation id="8821041990367117597">I-Decentr ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho ngoba imininingwane yokungena ngemvume kwe-akhawunti yakho angaphandle kwedethi.</translation>
<translation id="8862326446509486874">Awunawo amalungelo afanele wokufakwa okukuleveli yesistimu. Zama ukuqalisa isifaki futhi njengomlawuli.</translation>
<translation id="8880203542552872219">Uma kunjalo, sicela uhlele iphasiwedi yakho elondoloziwe ku-Decentr ukuze ifane nephasiwedi yakho entsha.</translation>
<translation id="8897323336392112261">Iphinda ilayishe ukuthi yiliphi ikhasi eliboniswayo uma uqala i-Decentr noma uchofoza kunkinobho ye-Ikhaya.</translation>
<translation id="8907580949721785412">I-Decentr izama ukubonisa amaphasiwedi. Thayipha iphasiwedi yakho ye-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="8941642502866065432">Ayikwazi ukubuyekeza i-Decentr</translation>
