<translation id="8986207147630327271">Ungeza iphrofayela yomsebenzi kulesi siphequluli futhi unikeza umlawuli wakho ulawulo olungaphezulu nje kwephrofayela yomsebenzi.</translation>
<translation id="9019929317751753759">Ukuze senze i-Decentr iphephe, sikhubaza isandiso esilandelayo esingafakiwe kuhlu lwe-<ph name="IDS_EXTENSION_WEB_STORE_TITLE" /> futhi kungenzeka singezwe ngaphandle kolwazi lakho.</translation>
